### Get all contacts (Local)
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### Get contact by ID (Local)
### Replace the ID below with a real _id from your MongoDB collection
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/660000000000000000000001

###

### Get all contacts (Render)
GET https://YOUR-RENDER-SERVICE-NAME.onrender.com/contacts

### Get contact by ID (Render)
### Replace the ID below with a real _id from your MongoDB collection
GET https://YOUR-RENDER-SERVICE-NAME.onrender.com/contacts/660000000000000000000001